
@startuml 04_GoldenKeyService

title 4. GoldenKeyService - 골든 키(황금 열쇠) 수집 진행도

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class GoldenKeyProgress {
  - PlayerId: Guid
  - GoldenKeysCollected: int
  - LevelsClearedTowardNextKey: int
  - LevelsNeededPerKey: int
  + RecordLevelCleared(): void
  + HasEarnedNewKey(): bool
  + ResetProgressCounter(): void
}

interface GoldenKeyRepository {
  + FindProgressByPlayerId(playerId: Guid): Task<GoldenKeyProgress>
  + SaveProgress(progress: GoldenKeyProgress): Task
}

interface GoldenKeyService {
  + RegisterLevelCleared(playerId: Guid): Result<GoldenKeyProgress, ServiceError>
}

class ServiceError <<see 00_CommonTypes>>

GoldenKeyService ..> GoldenKeyRepository : Task<T> 결과를 기다림(await)
GoldenKeyService ..> GoldenKeyProgress
GoldenKeyRepository ..> GoldenKeyProgress
GoldenKeyService ..> ServiceError : 실패 시 반환

note right of GoldenKeyService
  판정 규칙: LevelsClearedTowardNextKey가
  LevelsNeededPerKey에 도달하면 GoldenKeysCollected를 올리고
  ResetProgressCounter()를 호출함.
  게임이 끝나고 이겼을 때 GameSessionService가 이 서비스를 호출함.
end note

@enduml
